  "project_description": "AB Age Gate is a JavaScript/cookie age-verification splash overlay for age-restricted sites (e.g. alcohol brands under AB InBev). On every front-end page a full-screen overlay asks the visitor to confirm their age (full date of birth, yes/no, or a dynamic year prompt) before revealing the site; the choice is stored in an 'agegate' cookie so the gate does not reappear. It ships localized prompt text for many European locales, configurable branding (logo, background image/gradient, colors, font), an ignore-pages list, optional GTM dataLayer events, and a small per-day statistics table surfaced through a bundled View.",
